<title>BRAZIL: Banco do Brasil Q3 net at 123.9 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Banco do Brasil Q3 net at 123.9 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian federal bank Banco do Brasil posted a net profit of 123.975 million reais in the third quarter of 1996, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman said the bank posted a net profit of 49.028 million reais in September, or 0.07 reais per 1,000-share lot.</p>
<p>Banco do Brasil posted the country's largest-ever commercial loss in first-half 1996, plunging 7.8 billion reais into the red after posting a 4.2 billion real loss in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358</p>
</text>
